category: Science
requires: bash libhdf5-devel libyaml-cpp-devel libYODA0 pkg-config zlib-devel
sdesc: "Yet more Objects for Data Analysis (development)"
ldesc: "YODA is a small set of data analysis (specifically histogramming) classes
being developed by MCnet members as a lightweight common system for MC event
generator validation analyses, particularly as the core histogramming system
in Rivet."
external-source: YODA

